OL,3,GNEWSA'Some of these guys wouldn't be
OL,4,Ahere' if not for football chats
OL,5,
OL,6,FChatting about football is nothing new,
OL,7,Fbut using soccer to talk about what's
OL,8,Freally going on in your life is proving
OL,9,Fto be even better for some.
OL,11,FOn a Friday evening in summer, about 20
OL,12,Fmen have gathered for a kickabout in
OL,13,FCraigavon, in County Armagh.
OL,15,FIt may look like any other weekly
OL,16,Fkickabout but there's a difference -
OL,17,Fthe men here are encouraged to talk
OL,18,Fopenly.
OL,20,FThe beautiful game is their first step
OL,21,Ftowards opening up about addiction,
OL,22,Fisolation and mental health.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
